text.section:
Every license issued under this chapter shall bear:

For licenses issued or renewed on or after July 1, 2003, a license number which shall be assigned by the Department to the licensee and shall not be the same as the licensee's social security number;


A photograph of the licensee;


The licensee's full name, year, month, and date of birth;


The licensee's address, subject to the provisions of subsection B;


A brief description of the licensee for the purpose of identification;


A space for the signature of the licensee; and


Any other information deemed necessary by the Commissioner for the administration of this title.
				No abbreviated names or nicknames shall be shown on any license.
